  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining The Design**\n\nI\'m now implementing the specifics of a 6-row classroom layout for 42 students, which accounts for empty seating spots on the diagram grid. I\'ve also removed the organizational ranking feature, focusing solely on individual student performance. I will be refining this implementation by making updates that have been requested by the user.\n\n\n**Integrating Footer and Options**\n\nI\'ve added the requested footer \"10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225\" as well as implementing the grade bonus as an optional feature, toggled off by default. I am now working on phase 1 with the specified elements. Currently, I am focused on the interface and demo components as described in M\341\273\245c 15.\n\n\n**Developing New Features**\n\nI\'m now focusing on implementing several new features, including a \"Frequently Used\" behavior option with a save function and a bulk recording feature, allowing for multiple selections with a single touch. I\'m also adding a quick one-touch save mode as a user preference. Furthermore, I\'ve designed an intelligent duplicate entry warning system that escalates in severity depending on the nature of the violation. Additionally, an 8-second undo feature is being incorporated, along with an optimistic color change.\n\n\n**Constructing UI Components**\n\nI\'m now building the Teacher Pages with an overview, unlimited recording, explanation review, lists & diagrams, internal rules category, and optional settings with a grade bonus toggle, plus demo input/output. I\'ve also implemented a \"Sample Data\" bar with a quick role-switching button for easy testing. The footer displays \"10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225,\" and I\'m developing a sample dataset of 42 students. This includes diverse Vietnamese names, a 6-row classroom layout, common name variations, and various roles. It features approximately 60 sample records spanning 3 weeks.\n\n\n"
