  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Checking Font Specifications**\n\nI\'ve just reviewed the font requirements. The specification mandates \"Be Vietnam Pro\" for the entire interface, with weights of 400, 500, 600, and 700. System-ui is also provided as a fallback.\n\n\n**Defining Color Tokens**\n\nI\'m now focusing on implementing the color system using tokens, as described. I\'ve successfully translated the light and dark mode color mappings into CSS variables. I\'m making sure that no direct hex codes are used within components and that everything references these tokens to ensure consistent theming. I\'ve also confirmed that color tokens from Section 3.4 will follow this same implementation pattern.\n\n\n"
