  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Generating Mock Data**\n\nI\'m currently focused on constructing the `src/data/mockData.ts` file. I\'m aiming to generate data for 42 students, each with a unique `maHS` identifier ranging from HS01 to HS42. The students will have diverse Vietnamese names with authentic accents and distinctive surname, middle name, and first name combinations. My next step will be pairing the students.\n\n\n**Defining Student Relationships**\n\nI\'m now establishing student connections, including close naming conventions. I\'ve created sets of students with similar abbreviations, for example \"N.V.Huy\" and \"N.V.H\303\271ng\" or \"T.T.M.Anh\" and \"T.T.Minh Anh.\" I have also created four T\341\273\225 (groups), each assigned to different rows/columns, based on a 6-row arrangement.\n\n\n\n**Mapping Classroom Layout**\n\nI\'m now mapping out the classroom, considering rows (0-7) and columns (0-7). The top row features the door, podium, and teacher\'s desk. Row 1 is a passageway, and Rows 2-6 represent the desk rows, with aisles. I\'m meticulously placing empty desks (`loaiO: \'trong\'`) to ensure a realistic layout for 42 student seats.\n\n\n**Defining Behavior Metrics**\n\nI\'m now defining the behavior metrics. I\'ve categorized infractions, including severe ones like using phones during class (-5) and fighting (-5), alongside disciplinary actions, like dyeing hair (-3), and less severe, such as littering (-2). There\'s also a section for positive actions, which are only active when the teacher chooses to turn them on. I\'ve set default starting scores, thresholds, and disabled the \"bonus\" feature by default.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_15057036867975253453"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import { Student, SeatLayoutNode, RuleItem, DisciplineRecord, TeacherSettings } from \'../types\';\\n\\nexport const INITIAL_SETTINGS: TeacherSettings = {\\n  diemKhoiDau: 100,\\n  nguongTot: 90,\\n  nguongKha: 75,\\n  nguongDat: 60,\\n  batDiemCong: false, // M\341\272\267c \304\221\341\273\213nh T\341\272\256T theo y\303\252u c\341\272\247u\\n  batDiemThuongGoLoi: false,\\n  tranDiemBu: 50,\\n  thoiHanSuaHuyPhut: 1440, // 24 gi\341\273\235\\n  toTruongTuCham: false,\\n  hocSinhThayMau: \'CaLop\',\\n  hanGuiGiaiTrinhNgay: 7,\\n  nguoiDuyetGiaiTrinh: \'GV\',\\n  mocBuoiSang: \'06:30-11:30\',\\n  mocBuoiChieu: \'12:30-17:30\',\\n  khoaKhanCap: false,\\n  maLop: \'10A5DP\',\\n};\\n\\n// 42 h\341\273\215c sinh l\341\273\233p 10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225\\nexport const MOCK_STUDENTS: Student[] = [\\n  // T\341\273\224 1 (11 HS)\\n  { maHS: \'HS01\', hoTen: \'Nguy\341\273\205n Kh\341\272\257c Huy\', tenRutGon: \'N.K.Huy\', to: 1, dayBan: 1, soBan: 1, viTriGhe: 1, vaiTro: [\'LT\'] },\\n  { maHS: \'HS02\', hoTen: \'Tr\341\272\247n Th\341\273\213 Mai Anh\', tenRutGon: \'T.T.M.Anh\', to: 1, dayBan: 1, soBan: 1, viTriGhe: 2, vaiTro: [\'BT\', \'TT\'], toTruongTo: 1 },\\n  { maHS: \'HS03\', hoTen: \'L\303\252 Ho\303\240ng Long\', tenRutGon: \'L.H.Long\', to: 1, dayBan: 1, soBan: 2, viTriGhe: 3, vaiTro: [\'LP_HT\'] },\\n  { maHS: \'HS04\', hoTen: \'Ph\341\272\241m Qu\341\273\221c B\341\272\243o\', tenRutGon: \'P.Q.B\341\272\243o\', to: 1, dayBan: 1, soBan: 2, viTriGhe: 4, vaiTro: [\'LP_LD\'] },\\n  { maHS: \'HS05\', hoTen: \'Nguy\341\273\205n V\304\203n Huy\', tenRutGon: \'N.V.Huy\', to: 1, dayBan: 1, soBan: 3, viTriGhe: 5, vaiTro: [\'HS\'] },\\n  { maHS: \'HS06\', hoTen: \'Nguy\341\273\205n V\304\203n H\303\271ng\', tenRutGon: \'N.V.H\303\271ng\', to: 1, dayBan: 1, soBan: 3, viTriGhe: 6, vaiTro: [\'HS\'] },\\n  { maHS: \'HS07\', hoTen: \'\304\220inh Th\341\273\213 Thu\341\273\263 Tra