  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Components Now**\n\nI\'m now focused on component construction. I\'m starting with `src/components/common/Header.tsx`. This includes setting the class title to \"10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225\" and creating a current week indicator. I believe this will establish a foundation for the overall structure.\n\n\n**Adding User Interactions**\n\nI\'ve shifted my focus to enhancing user interaction. I\'m implementing a user badge with role color and full name, and adding a quick role switcher for testing. I\'m also including a theme toggle and a logout button. I\'m building out the footer with the required display, and working on the toast notification with a countdown and undo functionality. Lastly, the login modal now includes class code verification, student/BCS login, and a \"For Teachers\" login.\n\n\n**Developing Tabbed Views**\n\nI\'m now implementing the tab toggle for list and seat map views. The list view will have instant, accent-insensitive search, abbreviation support, group filters, and student cards. The seat map will feature 6 columns, with visual representations for empty slots, aisles, and other elements. I\'m focusing on abbreviated names, status borders, and group leader scope lighting. Multi-select support for \"Lu\341\273\223ng B\" is also in progress, along with responsive mobile toggles.\n\n\n**Implementing Record Logic**\n\nI\'m now implementing the multi-select save flow for \"Lu\341\273\223ng B\", focusing on one-touch fast save mode with undo. I\'m also adding category tabs for \"Chuy\303\252n c\341\272\247n\", \"H\341\273\215c t\341\272\255p\", \"N\341\273\201 n\341\272\277p\", \"Phong tr\303\240o\", and \"Lao \304\221\341\273\231ng - V\341\273\207 sinh\". Expandable details with date, session, and notes are being integrated. I\'m also building a duplicate warning modal, considering cases with identical or different infractions and multi-student scenarios, with appropriate warnings and default button focus.\n\n\n**Expanding Functionality Scope**\n\nI\'m now expanding the scope to include \"C\303\241 nh\303\242n\" and \"Ghi nh\341\272\255n\" toggles, a \"S\341\273\225 c\341\273\247a t\303\264i\" section with a 24-hour window for edits, and personal settings adjustments. I\'m also implementing the teacher dashboard with an overview of records, explanation queue management, and a class/seating editor. I\'m building out class and seating layouts, and I am adding \"Gi\341\272\243i tr\303\254nh\" for infractions. I am creating a toggle for classroom rules management.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_18132435468592652750"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { \\n  Sun, \\n  Moon, \\n  Monitor, \\n  LogOut, \\n  UserCheck, \\n  ShieldCheck, \\n  Sparkles,\\n  ChevronDown\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { Student, RoleCode } from \'../../types\';\\nimport { ROLE_CONFIG } from \'../../data/mockData\';\\n\\ninterface HeaderProps {\\n  currentUser: Student | { hoTen: string; vaiTro: RoleCode[] } | null;\\n  currentRole: RoleCode;\\n  onSwitchDemoRole: (role: RoleCode, studentId?: string) => void;\\n  onLogout: () => void;\\n  currentWeek: number;\\n  theme: \'light\' | \'dark\' | \'system\';\\n  onThemeChange: (theme: \'light\' | \'dark\' | \'system\') => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Header: React.FC<HeaderProps> = ({\\n  currentUser,\\n  currentRole,\\n  onSwitchDemoRole,\\n  onLogout,\\n  currentWeek,\\n  theme,\\n  onThemeChange,\\n}) => {\\n  const [showRoleMenu, setShowRoleMenu] = useState(false);\\n  const [showThemeMenu, setShowThemeMenu] = useState(false);\\n\\n  const roleInfo = ROLE_CONFIG[currentRole] || ROLE_CONFIG.HS;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"sticky top-0 z-30 bg-surface border-b border-token shadow-xs\\\">\\n      {/* Demo Banner */}\\n      <div className=\\\"bg-surface-2 px-3 py-1 text-xs border-b border-token flex items-center justify-between text-muted\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent animate-pulse\\\" />\\n          <span>Ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\273\231 Demo: D\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u m\341\272\253u n\341\273\231i b\341\273\231</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Demo Fast Role Switcher */}\\n        <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setShowRoleMenu(!showRoleMenu)}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-token text-main hover:bg-surface transition-colors font-medium text-xs cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            title=\\\"\304\220\341\273\225i vai tr\303\262 \304\221\341\273\203 th\341\273\255 nghi\341\273\207m giao di\341\273\207n\\\"\\n          >\\n            <span>Th\341\273\255 vai:</span>\\n            <span \\n              className=\\\"px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded font-semibold text-[11px]\\\"\\n              style={{ color: roleInfo.fg, backgroundColor: roleInfo.bg }}\\n            >\\n              {roleInfo.short} - {roleInfo.label}\\n            </span>\\n            <ChevronDown className=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-muted\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {showRoleMenu && (\\n            <div \\n              className=\\\"absolute right-0 top-full mt-1 w-56 bg-surface border border-token rounded-lg shadow-lg py-1 z-50 text-xs\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setShowRoleMenu(false)}\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                Ch\341\273\215n vai tr\303\262 th\341\273\255 nghi\341\273\207m\\n              </div>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => onSwitchDemoRole(\'GV\')}\\n                className=\\\"w-full text-left px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-surface-2 flex items-center justify-between text-main\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>Gi\303\241o vi\303\252n ch\341\273\247 nhi\341\273\207m</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-[var(--role-gv-bg)] text-[var(--role-gv-fg)]\\\">GV</span>\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => onSwitchDemoRole(\'LT\', \'HS01\')}\\n                className=\\\"w-full text-left px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-surface-2 flex items-center justify-between text-main\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>L\341\273\233p tr\306\260\341\273\237ng (Nguy\341\273\205n Kh\341\272\257c Huy)</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-[var(--role-lt-bg)] text-[var(--role-lt-fg)]\\\">LT</span>\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => onSwitchDemoRole(\'TT\', \'HS02\')}\\n                className=\\\"w-full text-left px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-surface-2 flex items-center justify-between text-main\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>T\341\273\225 tr\306\260\341\273\237ng T1 (Tr\341\272\247n Th\341\273\213 Mai Anh)</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-[var(--role-tt-bg)] text-[var(--role-tt-fg)]\\\">T1</span>\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => onSwitchDemoRole(\'TT\', \'HS12\')}\\n                className=\\\"w-full text-left px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-surface-2 flex items-center justify-between text-main\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>T\341\273\225 tr\306\260\341\273\237ng T2 (V\305\251 \304\220\303\254nh Tr\341\273\215ng)</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-[var(--role-tt-bg)] text-[var(--role-tt-fg)]\\\">T2</span>\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => onSwitchDemoRole(\'LP_LD\', \'HS04\')}\\n                className=\\\"w-full text-left px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-surface-2 flex items-center justify-between text-main\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>L\341\273\233p ph\303\263 Lao \304\221\341\273\231ng (Ph\341\272\241m Q. B\341\272\243o)</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-[var(--role-ld-bg)] text-[var(--role-ld-fg)]\\\">L\304\220</span>\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => onSwitchDemoRole(\'HS\', \'HS05\')}\\n                className=\\\"w-full text-left px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-surface-2 flex items-center justify-between text-main\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>H\341\273\215c sinh (Nguy\341\273\205n V\304\203n Huy)</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-2 text-muted\\\">HS</span>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Main Top Bar */}\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-2.5 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary font-bold text-sm tracking-tight\\\">\\n            10A5\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <h1 className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-main leading-none\\\">\\n              N\341\273\201 n\341\272\277p &amp; Thi \304\221ua\\n            </h1>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-muted font-medium mt-0.5\\\">\\n              10A5 \302\267 Tu\341\272\247n {currentWeek}\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* User Info & Controls */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n          {/* Theme Switcher */}\\n          <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setShowThemeMenu(!showThemeMenu)}\\n              className=\\\"p-2 rounded-lg border border-token text-muted hover:text-main hover:bg-surface-2 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n              title=\\\"\304\220\341\273\225i giao di\341\273\207n S\303\241ng / T\341\273\221i / H\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"\304\220\341\273\225i giao di\341\273\207n S\303\241ng / T\341\273\221i / H\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng\\\"\\n            >\\n              {theme === \'dark\' ? (\\n                <Moon className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-main\\\" />\\n              ) : theme === \'light\' ? (\\n                <Sun className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-main\\\" />\\n              ) : (\\n                <Monitor className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-main\\\" />\\n              )}\\n            </button>\\n\\n            {showThemeMenu && (\\n              <div \\n                className=\\\"absolute right-0 top-full mt-1 w-36 bg-surface border border-token rounded-lg shadow-lg py-1 z-50 text-xs\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setShowThemeMenu(false)}\\n              >\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => onThemeChange(\'light\')}\\n                  className={`w-full text-left px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-surface-2 flex items-center gap-2 ${\\n                    theme === \'light\' ? \'font-semibold text-accent\' : \'text-main\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <Sun className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                  <span>S\303\241ng</span>\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => onThemeChange(\'dark\')}\\n                  className={`w-full text-left px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-surface-2 flex items-center gap-2 ${\\n                    theme === \'dark\' ? \'font-semibold text-accent\' : \'text-main\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <Moon className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                  <span>T\341\273\221i</span>\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => onThemeChange(\'system\')}\\n                  className={`w-full text-left px-3 py-1.5 hover:bg-surface-2 flex items-center gap-2 ${\\n                    theme === \'system\' ? \'font-semibold text-accent\' : \'text-main\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <Monitor className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                  <span>Theo h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng</span>\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Current User Badge & Logout */}\\n          {currentUser && (\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 pl-1\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"hidden sm:flex flex-col ite