  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Time Hierarchy**\n\nI\'ve decided to formalize the time hierarchy in `src/types/index.ts`. I\'m introducing a `TimeHierarchy` interface. It includes fields for the academic year (`namHoc`), semester (`hocKi`), month (`thang`), and week of the semester (`tuanHoc`). I\'m using TypeScript\'s type literal feature to constrain `hocKi` to either 1 or 2.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3742370078811624982"
      name: "replace_file_content"
