  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: \"Web App Qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 N\341\273\201 n\341\272\277p & Thi \304\221ua L\341\273\233p h\341\273\215c\" (Classroom Discipline & Emulation Web App) v2.0 for Class 10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225.\n- **Key User Instructions & Adjustments**:\n  - Class size: 42 students, 6 desk rows/columns (`D\303\243y 1` to `D\303\243y 6`) with explicit empty slots (`loaiO: \'trong\'`), aisles, doors, teacher table, and podium.\n  - **No group scoring or ranking**: Completely removed group ranking/leaderboard calculation; focus exclusively on individual students and whole-class individual rankings.\n  - **Footer**: Strictly displays `10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225` without teacher name.\n  - **Bonus Points (\"\304\220i\341\273\203m c\341\273\231ng\")**: A teacher toggle in settings/rules, **default OFF** (only negative points by default).\n  - **Hierarchical Discipline Tracking (\"theo d\303\265i thi \304\221ua c\303\263 h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng, ph\303\242n c\341\272\245p t\341\273\253 n\304\203m h\341\273\215c-h\341\273\215c k\303\254-th\303\241ng-tu\341\272\247n-ng\303\240y-bu\341\273\225i\")**: Systematically organize and filter emulation across 6 hierarchical levels: N\304\203m h\341\273\215c (`namHoc`) $\\rightarrow$ H\341\273\215c k\303\254 (`hocKi`: 1 | 2) $\\rightarrow$ Th\303\241ng (`thang`: 1..12) $\\rightarrow$ Tu\341\272\247n (`tuanHoc`: 1..35) $\\rightarrow$ Ng\303\240y (`ngayHoc`: YYYY-MM-DD) $\\rightarrow$ Bu\341\273\225i (`buoi`: \'Sang\' | \'Chieu\').\n  - **Stage-by-Stage Roadmap** (M\341\273\245c 15):\n    - *Giai \304\221o\341\272\241n 1* (Completed & verified): Frontend + Demo mode with mock data, 2-touch flow, duplicate warning, role-based views.\n    - *Giai \304\221o\341\272\241n 2* (Next up): Server & Security with Google Apps Script (`Code.gs`), `setupSheets()`, session management, Google OAuth & OTP, `README_TrienKhai.md`.\n    - *Giai \304\221o\341\272\241n 3*: Explanations queue, Smart Import/Export parser (Word/Excel, Levenshtein fuzzy matching $\\le 2$), Parent report image cards.\n    - *Giai \304\221o\341\272\241n 4*: Offline queue (IndexedDB), PWA compliance.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Files Created/Modified**:\n  - `/metadata.json` & `/index.html`: Set app name to \"Qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 N\341\273\201 n\341\272\277p & Thi \304\221ua L\341\273\233p h\341\273\215c\", meta tags, Be Vietnam Pro font, theme-color meta, and initial `<script>` preventing theme flash.\n  - `/src/index.css`: Full CSS Design Tokens for Light/Dark modes (`--bg`, `--surface`, `--surface-2`, `--border`, `--text`, `--text-muted`, `--accent`, `--st-ok`, `--st-none`, `--st-warn`, `--st-bad`, `--role-*`), WCAG AA compliant, zero hardcoded colors.\n  - `/src/types/index.ts`: Full types for `Student`, `SeatLayoutNode`, `RuleItem`, `DisciplineRecord`, `StudentWeekSummary`, `StudentPeriodSummary`, `TeacherSettings`, `TimeHierarchy`, `HierarchyPeriodFilter`, `PeriodLevel`.\n  - `/src/utils/vietnamese.ts`: Accent stripping (`removeVietnameseAccents`), acronym/initials extraction (`getInitials`), fuzzy search, and Vietnamese alphabetical sorting by first name.\n  - `/src/utils/emulation.ts`: Score calculation (100 base, deductions, severity levels, evaluation tiers, color statuses, session determination, duplicate detection).\n  - `/src/utils/hierarchy.ts`: Hierarchical time mapping (`getTimeHierarchyFromDate`), hierarchical filtering (`filterRecordsByHierarchy`), and period summary calculation (`calculateStudentPeriodSummary`) across weeks, months, semesters, and year.\n  - `/src/data/mockData.ts`: 42 students, 4 groups, 6 desk columns with empty seats, 25 rules (5 categories + bonus), 60+ sample records spanning 3 weeks with dynamic `CURRENT_DATE` and `CURRENT_BUOI` for testing duplicate warnings.\n  - `/src/components/common/Header.tsx`: Top bar with class title, demo role switcher (GV, LT, TT T1, TT T2, LP_LD, HS), Light/Dark/System theme toggle, user badge, and logout.\n  - `/src/components/common/Footer.tsx`: Strictly renders `10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225`.\n  - `/src/components/common/Toast.tsx`: 8-second countdown with `Ho\303\240n t\303\241c` (Undo) button.\n  - `/src/components/common/PeriodHierarchyFilter.tsx`: New component supporting 6-tier drilldown (N\304\203m h\341\273\215c $\\rightarrow$ H\341\273\215c k\303\254 $\\rightarrow$ Th\303\241ng $\\rightarrow$ Tu\341\272\247n $\\rightarrow$ Ng\303\240y $\\rightarrow$ Bu\341\273\225i) and quick presets (H\303\264m nay, Tu\341\272\247n 3, Th\303\241ng 11, H\341\273\215c k\303\254 1, C\341\272\243 N\304\203m).\n  - `/src/components/student-picker/SeatGrid.tsx`: Interactive classroom layout with 42 student seats, empty spots, doors, podium, teacher desk, status borders, and scope locking (T\341\273\225 tr\306\260\341\273\237ng sees other groups dimmed to 30%, click-locked).\n  - `/src/components/student-picker/StudentPicker.tsx`: Toggle between [S\306\241 \304\221\341\273\223 l\341\273\233p] and [Danh s\303\241ch], Vietnamese search, group filter chips, and multi-select support.\n  - `/src/components/record/DuplicateWarningModal.tsx`: Smart duplicate warning (strong red warning with default `[H\341\273\247y b\341\273\217]` for identical violations; mild yellow with default `[X\303\241c nh\341\272\255n ghi th\303\252m]` for different violations; per-student toggle for multi-select).\n  - `/src/components/record/RecordBottomSheet.tsx`: 2-touch flow bottom sheet with pinned \"Hay d\303\271ng\" buttons, search, category tabs, and collapsible extra details (date, session, note).\n  - `/src/components/student/StudentView.tsx`: Tabs for \"C\341\273\247a t\303\264i\", \"S\306\241 \304\221\341\273\223 l\341\273\233p\", and \"B\341\272\243ng thi \304\221ua\" (individual rankings, no group scoring), plus explanation modal (max 300 chars).\n  - `/src/components/cadre/CadreView.tsx`: Cadre view with [Ghi nh\341\272\255n], [S\341\273\225 c\341\273\247a t\303\264i] (24h edit/void window with live countdown), and [C\303\241 nh\303\242n].\n  - `/src/components/teacher/TeacherDashboard.tsx`: Comprehensive dashboard for Overview, Record, Explanations queue, Roster & Seating, Rules & Bonus toggle, Import/Export preview, and System settings.\n  - `/src/components/auth/LoginModal.tsx`: Class code gate (`10A5DP`), student selection without exposing status colors/points before login, 5-attempt brute-force lockout, and dedicated Teacher Google / OTP portal.\n  - `/src/App.tsx`: Main SPA wiring state, theme, role views, undo toasts, and modals.\n- **Verification**: `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` executed with 0 errors. Browser automation verified on mobile viewport (390x844) via Playwright CLI: captured `.playwright-cli/mobile-overview.png`, `.playwright-cli/cadre-view.png`, `.playwright-cli/bottom-sheet.png`, `.playwright-cli/student-view.png`, and `.playwright-cli/dark-theme.png`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Decisions\n- **Hierarchy Integration**: The hierarchy requirement (\"ph\303\242n c\341\272\245p t\341\273\253 n\304\203m h\341\273\215c-h\341\273\215c k\303\254-th\303\241ng-tu\341\272\247n-ng\303\240y-bu\341\273\225i\") seamlessly connects every record to `namHoc` (\'2026-2027\'), `hocKi` (1 | 2), `thang` (9..5), `tuanHoc` (1..35), `ngayHoc` (YYYY-MM-DD), and `buoi` (\'Sang\' | \'Chieu\').\n- **Privacy & Permissions**: Before login, student picker hides all point badges and status colors. Students never see classmate deduction reasons/points. Cadres can only modify records created by themselves within 24 hours. T\341\273\225 tr\306\260\341\273\237ng is hard-locked to their own group.\n- **Design Tokens**: Complete avoidance of hardcoded colors; strict use of CSS variables ensure Light and Dark modes render WCAG AA contrast without text washout.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes\n- *Playwright selector strict mode violation*: `button:has-text(\'\304\220i mu\341\273\231n\')` matched both the \"Hay d\303\271ng\" button and the list button. Fixed by targeting `page.getByRole(\'button\', { name: \'\304\220i mu\341\273\231n -2\304\221\' })`.\n- *Screenshot timeout on Google Fonts*: Playwright screenshot waited for Google Fonts (`fonts.googleapis.com`) to load, occasionally timing out on headless shell. Resolved by ensuring dev server is restarted and actions are targeted cleanly.\n- *Date mismatch in duplicate test*: Today\'s mock record had a static date while `RecordBottomSheet` used current ISO date. Fixed by making `CURRENT_DATE = new Date().toISOString().split(\'T\')[0]` and `CURRENT_BUOI` dynamic in `src/data/mockData.ts`.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- The app compiles cleanly (`tsc --noEmit` exits with 0).\n- The new `PeriodHierarchyFilter.tsx` component and `src/utils/hierarchy.ts` have been written to support the hierarchical tracking requirement.\n- The next step is wiring `PeriodHierarchyFilter` into `StudentView`, `CadreView`, and `TeacherDashboard` so users can filter and view statistics by school year, semester, month, week, day, and session.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Next Steps\n1. **Wire Hierarchical Tracking into UI Views**:\n   - In `StudentView`: Integrate `PeriodHierarchyFilter` above the score card; allow students to view their performance by week, month, semester 1, or whole year with multi-week trend history.\n   - In `CadreView`: Display `PeriodHierarchyFilter` in \"S\341\273\225 c\341\273\247a t\303\264i\" and auto-populate hierarchical fields (`namHoc`, `hocKi`, `thang`, `tuanHoc`) when creating records.\n   - In `TeacherDashboard`: Embed `PeriodHierarchyFilter` in Overview and Roster to inspect reports per Session, Day, Week, Month, Semester, or School Year.\n2. **Execute Giai \304\221o\341\272\241n 2 (M\303\241y ch\341\273\247 & Tri\341\273\203n khai)**:\n   - Create single `Code.gs` with full API actions (`classPublic`, `loginStudent`, `loginTeacherGoogle`, `addRecords`, `voidRecord`, `resolveExplanation`, `exportQuery`, etc.) and `setupSheets()` creating the 13 sheets with frozen headers.\n   - Implement server-side password hashing with salt + `PEPPER`, session tokens in `11_PhienDangNhap`, and server-side RBAC + group locks.\n   - Create `README_TrienKhai.md` in Vietnamese guiding Google Sheet setup, Apps Script deployment, Google OAuth Client ID setup, and hosting.\n3. **Verify with `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, and browser screenshots**.\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Language: 100% Vietnamese with proper accents.\n- Responsive design: Mobile-first (360px+), touch targets $\\ge 44\\times 44\\text{px}$.\n- Visuals: Strictly design tokens (no hardcoded colors), Lucide icons (no emojis), no purple-blue AI gradients.\n- Footer: Must remain `10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225` without teacher name.\n- Group Emulation: No group scoring/rankings; focus solely on individual student discipline.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_end: 124
    render_latest_checkpoint: true
