    thinking: "**Visualizing Age-Appropriate Design**\n\nI\'m focusing on making the interface visually appealing and age-appropriate. I\'m incorporating images, icons, and emojis to connect with the target age group. I\'m also considering badges for the student leaders to enhance engagement.\n\n\n"
