  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Requirements**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the user\'s prompt, focusing on the core requirements. I\'m prioritizing the user\'s need for an interface that caters to the psychology of 15-16 year olds. This includes considering visual elements like images, icons, and emojis, alongside more specific elements for the student council, like badges.\n\n\n**Visualizing the Concepts**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the visual elements. I\'m imagining achievement badges (\"Hi\341\273\207p s\304\251 \304\220\303\272ng gi\341\273\235,\" etc.) and streak counters (\"3 tu\341\272\247n li\341\273\201n T\341\273\221t\"). I\'m also considering friendly avatar placeholders or colorful initials, and welcoming banners. I\'m focusing on the Vietnamese high school context, envisioning modern uniforms (\303\241o d\303\240i/\303\241o s\306\241 mi) and school environments. The goal is to capture the youthful and friendly essence.\n\n\n**Enumerating Visual Elements**\n\nI\'m now cataloging all the image assets needed. I will prepare calls to generate the images. I\'m also planning the tasteful integration of icons (Lucide icons) and energetic emojis (\360\237\214\237, \360\237\217\206, etc.) to enhance appeal, while maintaining readability. I\'ve designed some reaction stickers. I\'m also building out distinctive badges and honors for Cadre roles, like the \"L\341\273\233p tr\306\260\341\273\237ng\" with a gold badge and crown icon, highlighting their \"Ch\341\273\211 Huy Tr\306\260\341\273\237ng\" role.\n\n\n**Defining Cadre Badges**\n\nI\'m currently finalizing the cadre badge designs and integrating hierarchical tracking. I\'ve conceived unique badges for each role: \"Ng\341\273\215n C\341\273\235 \304\220o\303\240n\" for B\303\255 th\306\260, \"H\341\273\215c Gi\341\272\243 10A5\" for L\341\273\233p ph\303\263 H\341\273\215c t\341\272\255p, \"Chi\341\272\277n Binh N\304\203ng \304\220\341\273\231ng\" for L\341\273\233p ph\303\263 Lao \304\221\341\273\231ng, and \"Th\341\273\247 L\304\251nh T\341\273\225\" for T\341\273\225 tr\306\260\341\273\237ng. I am also implementing unlockable badges for H\341\273\215c sinh g\306\260\306\241ng m\341\272\253u. I\'m also ensuring these badges are prominently displayed on profiles and seating charts. Finally, I\'m integrating the hierarchical time filter for seamless navigation across views.\n\n\n**Enforcing Core Constraints**\n\nI\'m now integrating critical constraints to solidify the design. I\'m making sure there are 42 students, arranged in six rows, with empty seats. Group scoring and ranking are strictly forbidden. The footer will be fixed as `10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225`, excluding the teacher\'s name. I\'m also ensuring the teacher can toggle bonus points.\n\nI\'m also preparing for the image generation batch. I\'m focusing on three specific assets: a vibrant classroom banner (`hero_class_10a5`), a leadership crest (`cadre_leadership_crest`), and an honor student trophy (`honor_student_trophy`). I will trigger image generation in a single, parallel batch.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_12716874195600993078"
