  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Component Needs**\n\nI\'m currently focused on identifying the necessary components. I\'ve pinpointed `CadreBadge.tsx` as a key area, envisioning a dynamic display with badge medals, emojis, and a dedicated \"B\341\272\243ng Vinh Danh\" button linked to the crest image. The analysis must cover rendering needs for components as well as their associated behaviors.\n\n\n**Defining Modal and Editor**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics. I\'m imagining a prestigious modal in `CadreHonorsModal.tsx`, showcasing all six cadre roles with their crests, names, positions, and mottos. Also, I\'m fully defining the features for `ClassroomLayoutEditor.tsx`. I\'ve outlined drag-and-drop seat swapping with mobile click fallbacks. I\'ve also detailed drag/move to empty spots, node type changes with structure mode, and quick rearrangement presets for rapid edits with a live preview/save button.\n\n\n**Revisiting App State**\n\nI\'m now back at the application state and localStorage. My focus is expanding on `SeatGrid.tsx` with cadre emojis on Ban C\303\241n S\341\273\261 desks and GVCN-based editing. Additionally, I\'m thinking through student views in `StudentView.tsx`, adding a trophy image and badges, a teen-friendly \"Huy hi\341\273\207u & Th\303\240nh t\303\255ch C\303\241 nh\303\242n\" tab, and a motto banner. Plus, I want to show score trends using the `PeriodHierarchyFilter`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5731873097624593217"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { RoleCode } from \'../../types\';\\nimport { CADRE_ROLES_INFO } from \'../../data/badgeData\';\\n\\ninterface CadreBadgeProps {\\n  role: RoleCode;\\n  toTruongTo?: number;\\n  size?: \'sm\' | \'md\' | \'lg\';\\n  showDuty?: boolean;\\n  onClick?: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const CadreBadge: React.FC<CadreBadgeProps> = ({\\n  role,\\n  toTruongTo,\\n  size = \'md\',\\n  showDuty = false,\\n  onClick\\n}) => {\\n  const info = CADRE_ROLES_INFO[role] || CADRE_ROLES_INFO.HS;\\n  const isCadre = role !== \'HS\';\\n\\n  const title = role === \'TT\' && toTruongTo ? `T\341\273\225 tr\306\260\341\273\237ng T\341\273\225 ${toTruongTo}` : info.title;\\n  const badgeName = role === \'TT\' && toTruongTo ? `Th\341\273\247 L\304\251nh T\341\273\225 ${toTruongTo}` : info.badgeName;\\n\\n  if (size === \'sm\') {\\n    return (\\n      <span\\n        onClick={onClick}\\n        className={`inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px] font-bold transition-transform ${\\n          onClick ? \'cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 active:scale-95\' : \'\'\\n        }`}\\n        style={{\\n          color: info.accentColor,\\n          backgroundColor: `${info.accentColor}18`,\\n          border: `1px solid ${info.accentColor}35`\\n        }}\\n        title={`${title} \302\267 ${badgeName}`}\\n      >\\n        <span>{info.shortEmoji}</span>\\n        <span>{title}</span>\\n      </span>\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  if (size === \'lg\') {\\n    return (\\n      <div\\n        onClick={onClick}\\n        className={`relative overflow-hidden p-3.5 rounded-2xl border transition-all ${\\n          info.borderTone\\n        } bg-gradient-to-br ${info.gradientBg} bg-surface ${\\n          onClick ? \'cursor-pointer hover:shadow-md active:scale-[0.99]\' : \'\'\\n        }`}\\n      >\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n          <div \\n            className=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shadow-inner shrink-0\\\"\\n            style={{ backgroundColor: `${info.accentColor}25`, border: `1.5px solid ${info.accentColor}50` }}\\n          >\\n            {info.emoji}\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"min-w-0 flex-1\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted\\\">\\n                {info.badgeLevel}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <h4 className=\\\"text-base font-extrabold text-main truncate leading-tight mt-0.5\\\">\\n              {badgeName}\\n            </h4>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold\\\" style={{ color: info.accentColor }}>\\n              {title}\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {showDuty && (\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-3 pt-2.5 border-t border-token/60 space-y-1 text-xs\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"italic text-muted font-medium\\\">\\\"{info.motto}\\\"</div>\\n            <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-main opacity-90 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              <strong>Nhi\341\273\207m v\341\273\245:</strong> {info.duty}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n      </div>\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  // Medium (default)\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      onClick={onClick}\\n      className={`inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold border transition-all ${\\n        info.borderTone\\n      } ${onClick ? \'cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 active:scale-95\' : \'\'}`}\\n      style={{\\n        color: info.accentColor,\\n        backgroundColor: `${info.accentColor}15`\\n      }}\\n      title={`${title} - ${info.motto}`}\\n    >\\n      <span className=\\\"text-sm\\\">{info.shortEmoji}</span>\\n      <span>{badgeName}</span>\\n      <span className=\\\"text-[10px] opacity-75 font-medium\\\">({title})</span>\\n    </div>\\n 