  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Cadre Emoji Display**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing `SeatGrid.tsx`. My primary goal is to integrate each cadre\'s unique emoji directly onto their respective desks. The objective is to make the desk display reflect each cadre\'s emoji (\360\237\221\221 LT, \360\237\232\251 BT, \360\237\223\226 HT, \342\232\241 L\304\220, \360\237\233\241\357\270\217 TT). Additionally, I\'m working on conditional rendering based on the viewer\'s role, specifically enabling edit functionality for `GV` users.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14017166563372026289"
