    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: \"Web App Qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 N\341\273\201 n\341\272\277p & Thi \304\221ua L\341\273\233p h\341\273\215c\" (Classroom Discipline & Emulation Web App) for Class 10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225.\n- **Latest User Request**:\n  1. *\"V\341\273\213 tr\303\255 b\303\240n gi\303\241o vi\303\252n \304\221\341\273\225i v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 cho c\341\273\255a tr\306\260\341\273\233c\"*: Swap the positions of the Teacher Desk (\"B\303\240n GV\") and the Front Door (\"C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh\") so B\303\240n GV is on the left and C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh is on the right.\n  2. *\"\304\220\341\273\223ng th\341\273\235i l\303\240m \304\221\306\241n gi\341\272\243n ho\303\241 c\303\241c c\303\241i n\303\240y (ch\341\273\211 c\341\272\247n c\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh, b\341\272\243ng, b\303\240n GV \341\273\237 d\341\272\241ng ch\341\273\257 ko dongds \303\264)\"*: Remove clunky rectangular boxed grid cells in row 0; render the front of the classroom purely as unboxed text labels: `B\303\240n GV` (left) ... `\342\200\224 B\341\272\242NG \342\200\224` (center) ... `C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh` (right).\n- **Core Invariants & Previous Directives**:\n  - 42 students across 6 desk columns with aisles and empty slots.\n  - No group scoring or rankings; exclusively individual student discipline and rankings.\n  - Footer strictly displays `10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225` without teacher name.\n  - Bonus points (\"\304\220i\341\273\203m c\341\273\231ng\") toggleable by teacher, default OFF.\n  - Hierarchical discipline tracking across 6 levels: N\304\203m h\341\273\215c $\\rightarrow$ H\341\273\215c k\303\254 $\\rightarrow$ Th\303\241ng $\\rightarrow$ Tu\341\272\247n $\\rightarrow$ Ng\303\240y $\\rightarrow$ Bu\341\273\225i.\n  - Youthful, high-school psychology (grade 10): badges for cadres (\360\237\221\221 LT, \360\237\232\251 BT, \360\237\223\226 HT, \342\232\241 L\304\220, \360\237\233\241\357\270\217 TT), achievement badges for students, motivational mottos, clean avatars.\n  - GVCN can drag & drop students and re-arrange classroom structure.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Completed & Verified Files**:\n  - `/src/data/mockData.ts`:\n    - Updated `MOCK_SEAT_LAYOUT` row 0: columns 0-1 set to `banGV` (\"B\303\240n GV\"), columns 3-4 to `buc` (\"B\341\272\243ng\"), columns 6-7 to `cua` (\"C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh\").\n    - Fixed syntax error (added missing closing bracket `}` in `RAW_RECORDS`).\n  - `/src/components/student-picker/SeatGrid.tsx`:\n    - Replaced the bulky 8-cell row 0 with an unboxed text header bar: `B\303\240n GV` (left) \342\200\224 `\342\200\224 B\341\272\242NG \342\200\224` (center) \342\200\224 `C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh` (right) without boxed borders (\"\341\273\237 d\341\272\241ng ch\341\273\257 kh\303\264ng \304\221\303\263ng \303\264\").\n    - Simplified row 8 (Cu\341\273\221i l\341\273\233p) into a clean, minimal text indicator (`C\341\273\255a sau` / `Cu\341\273\221i l\341\273\233p`) without empty boxed tiles.\n    - Added cadre emojis (`\360\237\221\221`, `\360\237\232\251`, `\360\237\223\226`, `\342\232\241`, `\360\237\233\241\357\270\217`) and seat numbers directly on student desks.\n  - `/src/components/teacher/ClassroomLayoutEditor.tsx`:\n    - Implemented full drag-and-drop & touch-to-swap classroom seating editor for GVCN.\n    - Allows changing structure or switching sides: \"B\303\240n GV b\303\252n tr\303\241i, C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh b\303\252n ph\341\272\243i\" vs \"B\303\240n GV b\303\252n ph\341\272\243i, C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh b\303\252n tr\303\241i\".\n  - `/src/components/common/CadreBadge.tsx` & `/src/components/common/CadreHonorsModal.tsx`:\n    - Heraldic leadership badges for LT, BT, LP_HT, LP_LD, TT 1..4.\n    - Honors modal featuring the generated leadership crest asset (`/src/assets/images/cadre_leadership_crest_1794145976007.jpg`).\n  - `/src/components/student/StudentView.tsx`:\n    - Integrated `PeriodHierarchyFilter`, student trophy asset (`/src/assets/images/honor_student_trophy_1794145975161.jpg`), unlocked badges (K\341\273\267 Lu\341\272\255t Th\303\251p \360\237\233\241\357\270\217, Chi\341\272\277n Th\341\272\247n \304\220\303\272ng Gi\341\273\235 \342\217\260, etc.), and teenage motivational motto banner.\n  - `/src/components/cadre/CadreView.tsx`:\n    - Integrated Cadre Leadership Crest, Cadre badges, and `PeriodHierarchyFilter` for \"S\341\273\225 c\341\273\247a t\303\264i\".\n  - `/src/components/teacher/TeacherDashboard.tsx`:\n    - Integrated hero classroom banner (`/src/assets/images/hero_class_10a5_1794145975717.jpg`), `PeriodHierarchyFilter`, and quick launcher for `ClassroomLayoutEditor` and `CadreHonorsModal`.\n  - `/src/components/common/Toast.tsx`:\n    - Fixed timer bug (separated countdown state updater from `onClose` callback to avoid React warning).\n  - `/src/App.tsx`:\n    - Added `handleUpdateLayout` callback, updating both `layout` and `students` in state and `localStorage`.\n- **Verification**:\n  - `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` both passed with 0 errors.\n  - Dev server restarted and running on port 3000.\n  - Browser verification executed via Playwright CLI: tested opening layout editor, swapping student positions (N.K.Huy \342\207\204 H.G.B\341\272\243o), applying layout, viewing Cadre honors modal, and switching to student role.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Decisions\n- **Simplified Top Strip (\"Kh\303\264ng \304\221\303\263ng \303\264\")**: Rendering row 0 as a clean flex text row (`w-full flex items-center justify-between border-b border-dashed border-token/60 py-1.5 px-3`) perfectly meets the user\'s intent to avoid ugly, rigid, empty rectangular boxes for doors and teacher desk.\n- **LocalStorage Layout Migration**: `App.tsx` initializes `layout` from `localStorage.getItem(\'app_layout_10a5\')`. In `App.tsx`, if a cached layout exists with the old order (where col 0 was `cua`), it should automatically update row 0 to place `banGV` on the left and `cua` on the right, ensuring existing browser sessions see the swap immediately.\n- **Touch & Drag-and-Drop Parity**: Mobile users cannot easily drag and drop; having both HTML5 Drag & Drop and click-to-swap ensures complete usability across desktop and mobile viewports.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes\n- *`mockData.ts(604,1)` syntax error*: Missing `}` closing the last raw record object before `]`. Fixed by adding `}` on line 604.\n- *`App.tsx(59,40)` missing import*: `SeatLayoutNode` was used as a type annotation without being imported. Added to `import { ... } from \'./types\'`.\n- *`ToastData` property mismatch in `App.tsx`*: Passed `{ type, title, message }` instead of `{ id, message, subMessage }`. Corrected to `{ id, message, subMessage }`.\n- *`PeriodHierarchyFilter` prop name error*: Components passed `onChange` instead of `onChangeFilter`. Updated in `StudentView`, `CadreView`, and `TeacherDashboard`.\n- *`checkDuplicateRecord` argument mismatch*: Passed `(st.maHS, rule.maNoiQuy, records, date, buoi)` instead of `(records, st.maHS, date, session, rule.maNoiQuy)`. Corrected in `CadreView.tsx`.\n- *`RecordBottomSheet` & `DuplicateWarningModal` prop mismatches in `CadreView.tsx`*: Aligned prop names (`students`, `onSave`, `currentUserRole` for sheet; `isOpen`, `selectedStudents`, `selectedRule`, `existingRecordsByStudent`, `onConfirm` for modal).\n- *`calculateStudentPeriodSummary` signature in `StudentView.tsx`*: Took 4 arguments for a single student. Calculated map per student and indexed cleanly.\n- *React setState in render warning in `Toast.tsx`*: `onClose()` was called inside `setSecondsLeft(prev => ...)`. Fixed by separating `setTimeout` from `setInterval`.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- All code compiles and lints with 0 errors (`tsc --noEmit` exits 0).\n- `SeatGrid.tsx` has been updated with the unboxed text row 0 (B\303\240n GV left, B\341\272\243ng center, C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh right).\n- The remaining work in progress is ensuring `ClassroomLayoutEditor.tsx` also renders row 0 in clean unboxed text format in seating mode, and adding a cache-busting check in `App.tsx` to ensure any cached layout in `localStorage` swaps B\303\240n GV and C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Next Steps\n1. **Update `ClassroomLayoutEditor.tsx`**:\n   - In row 0 rendering: When `mode === \'seating\'`, render row 0 as clean unboxed text (`B\303\240n GV` left, `\342\200\224 B\341\272\242NG \342\200\224` center, `C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh` right) matching `SeatGrid.tsx`.\n   - Update `applyPresetTeacherDesk(\'left\')` to ensure default is B\303\240n GV on columns 0-1 and C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh on columns 6-7.\n2. **Add Layout Cache Migration in `App.tsx`**:\n   - In `App.tsx` initialization of `layout`: If cached layout has `cua` at col 0 and `banGV` at col 6/7, update row 0 so `banGV` is at col 0-1 and `cua` is at col 6-7, then persist to `localStorage`.\n3. **Verify with `compile_applet` & `lint_applet`**:\n   - Run compilation and linting together to confirm zero errors.\n4. **Browser Verification via Playwright CLI**:\n   - Inspect `http://localhost:3000` to verify:\n     - Top of seating chart shows `B\303\240n GV` (left) ... `\342\200\224 B\341\272\242NG \342\200\224` (center) ... `C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh` (right) as clean unboxed text without rectangular boxes.\n     - Bottom of seating chart shows minimal `C\341\273\255a sau` / `Cu\341\273\221i l\341\273\233p`.\n     - Footer remains strictly `10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225`.\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Language: 100% Vietnamese with proper accents.\n- Responsive design: Mobile-first (360px+), touch targets $\\ge 44\\times 44\\text{px}$.\n- Visuals: Design tokens only, no hardcoded colors, no purple-blue AI slop, no clunky boxes for architectural labels.\n- Footer: Must remain `10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225` without teacher name.\n- Group Emulation: Strictly no group scoring or group leaderboard; only individual student discipline.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 124
