  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying UI Elements**\n\nI\'ve got Playwright up and running and I\'m focused on creating a Node.js script to verify the UI elements on `http://localhost:3000`. My immediate objective is to confirm the seat grid\'s top header displays \"B\303\240n GV\" on the left, \"\342\200\224 B\341\272\242NG \342\200\224\" in the middle, and \"C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh\" on the right, without any visible borders. Next, I need to test that a function will open.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5480592305694258419"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"node -e \'\\nconst { chromium } = require(\\\"playwright\\\");\\n\\n(async () => {\\n  const browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: true });\\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\\n  await page.setViewportSize({ width: 1280, height: 900 });\\n  \\n  await page.goto(\\\"http://localhost:3000\\\", { waitUntil: \\\"networkidle\\\" });\\n  console.log(\\\"Page loaded:\\\", await page.title());\\n\\n  // Check top header unboxed text in main view\\n  const banGV = await page.locator(\\\"text=B\303\240n GV\\\").first().innerText();\\n  const bang = await page.locator(\\\"text=\342\200\224 B\341\272\242NG \342\200\224\\\").first().innerText();\\n  const cuaChinh = await page.locator(\\\"text=C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh\\\").first().innerText();\\n  console.log(\\\"Found unboxed labels:\\\", { banGV, bang, cuaChinh });\\n\\n  // Open Layout editor\\n  const editBtn = page.locator(\\\"button:has-text(\\\\\\\"S\341\272\257p x\341\272\277p ch\341\273\227 ng\341\273\223i\\\\\\\")\\\");\\n  await editBtn.click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(500);\\n\\n  const modalTitle = await page.locator(\\\"text=S\341\272\257p x\341\272\277p S\306\241 \304\221\341\273\223 & K\303\251o th\341\272\243 Ch\341\273\227 ng\341\273\223i\\\").isVisible();\\n  console.log(\\\"Modal opened:\\\", modalTitle);\\n\\n  // Check Swap button\\n  const swapBtn = page.locator(\\\"button:has-text(\\\\\\\"Ho\303\241n \304\221\341\273\225i B\303\240n GV \342\207\204 C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh\\\\\\\")\\\");\\n  const swapVisible = await swapBtn.isVisible();\\n  console.log(\\\"Swap button visible:\\\", swapVisible);\\n\\n  // Click swap\\n  await swapBtn.click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(300);\\n\\n  // Save layout\\n  const saveBtn = page.locator(\\\"button:has-text(\\\\\\\"\303\201p d\341\273\245ng s\306\241 \304\221\341\273\223\\\\\\\")\\\");\\n  await saveBtn.click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(500);\\n\\n  // Check Toast\\n  const toastVisible = 