  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Sound Effects**\n\nI\'m currently focused on developing a sound effects module. My aim is a `/src/components/teacher/calling-games/` folder, specifically, the `/src/components/teacher/apps/` folder, to house modular components. A key component is `soundEffects.ts`, which utilizes the Web Audio API for realistic and reliable sounds. I\'m focusing on essential sound effects, such as beeps, ticks, spins, booms, fanfares, coin chimes, lasers, drumrolls, and buzzers, to work across browsers.\n\n\n**Designing Game Hub**\n\nI\'m now deep in the design of `CallingGamesHub.tsx`. I\'ve outlined the core features: a game selector grid with filter options for t\341\273\225, gi\341\273\233i t\303\255nh, and student exclusion. There\'s also a history log for called students and an audio toggle. The core is the array of 10 game views including the `WheelOfFortune`, `TimeBomb`, `SlotMachine` and more.\n\n\n"
