  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Synthesizing New Requirements**\n\nI\'m now integrating the recent request: enabling teachers to import schedule data via file upload. This expands the scope to accommodate various file formats like Excel, CSV, and JSON, encompassing time-stamped records, schedules, and time hierarchies. I\'m considering the potential impact on data validation and the user interface.\n\n\n"
