  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Data Import**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enabling teachers to easily upload their academic schedules. I\'m exploring file import options, specifically CSV, Excel (.xlsx), JSON, and .txt formats. This functionality will allow for efficient input of the time hierarchy, encompassing the academic year, semesters, and individual weeks.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Functionality**\n\nI\'m now integrating time-stamped emulation records, focusing on CSV and Excel formats for daily attendance and behavior tracking. The input data will include date, time, week, student ID/name, behavior, points, and recorder. I envision a user-friendly interface with drag-and-drop file upload, row preview, validation checks, and an \"Import\" button. Additionally, I\'ll provide a downloadable template and ensure seamless navigation of imported weeks and dates within the hierarchy filters. Finally, I will review all game callings with the addition of games such as TimeBomb and SlotMachine.\n\n\n**Developing Game Interface**\n\nI\'m now focusing on implementing the remaining game interfaces. I\'m starting with `TimeBomb.tsx`, aiming to create an engaging experience. It will feature a burning fuse animation, accelerating student name cycling, and sound effects to build tension. The climax will be an explosion and winner reveal. I\'m planning to use a modal for the final display.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5742431042338031509"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState, useEffect, useRef } from \'react\';\\nimport { ArrowLeft, Bomb, Flame, Sparkles, Play, RotateCcw } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { Student } from \'../../../types\';\\nimport { soundEffects } from \'../../../utils/soundEffects\';\\n\\ninterface TimeBombProps {\\n  candidates: Student[];\\n  onSelectWinner: (student: Student) => void;\\n  onBack: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const TimeBomb: React.FC<TimeBombProps> = ({\\n  candidates,\\n  onSelectWinner,\\n  onBack,\\n}) => {\\n  const [isRunning, setIsRunning] = useState(false);\\n  const [currentCandidate, setCurrentCandidate] = useState<Student | null>(null);\\n  const [isExploded, setIsExploded] = useState(false);\\n  const [fusePercent, setFusePercent] = useState(100);\\n  const timerRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\\n\\n  const startBomb = () => {\\n    if (isRunning || candidates.length === 0) return;\\n\\n    setIsRunning(true);\\n    setIsExploded(false);\\n    setFusePercent(100);\\n\\n    const totalDuration = 4200; // 4.2 seconds\\n    const startTime = performance.now();\\n    let tickInterval = 140; // Starts at 140ms, speeds up to 35ms\\n\\n    const step = () => {\\n      const now = performance.now();\\n      const elapsed = now - startTime;\\n      const progress = Math.min(elapsed / totalDuration, 1);\\n\\n      // Remaining fuse\\n      setFusePercent(Math.max(0, 100 - progress * 100));\\n\\n      // Pick random candidate\\n      const randomIndex = Math.floor(Math.random() * candidates.length);\\n      const picked = candidates[randomIndex];\\n      setCurrentCandidate(picked);\\n\\n      // Sound tick with rising pitch\\n      const pitch = 600 + progress * 700;\\n      soundEffects.tick(pitch);\\n\\n      if (progress < 1) {\\n        // Accelerate cycle\\n        tickInterval = Math.max(35, 140 - progress * 105);\\n        timerRef.current = window.setTimeout(step, tickInterval);\\n      } else {\\n        // BOOM!\\n        setIsRunning(false);\\n        setIsExploded(true);\\n        soundEffects.boom();\\n\\n        setTimeout(() => {\\n          onSelectWinner(picked);\\n        }, 800);\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    timerRef.current = window.setTimeout(step, tickInterval);\\n  };\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    return () => {\\n      if (timerRef.current) clearTimeout(timerRef.current);\\n    };\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 py-2 animate-fade-in w-full max-w-lg mx-auto text-center\\\">\\n      {/* Top Bar */}\\n      <div className=\\\"w-full flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n        <button\\n          onClick={onBack}\\n          className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-token text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:text-main cursor-pointer\\\"\\n        >\\n          <ArrowLeft className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n          <span>Ch\341\273\215n tr\303\262 kh\303\241c</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-red-500 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/15 border border-red-500/30 flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n          <Flame className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n          <span>Chi\341\272\277c Gh\341\272\277 N\303\263ng &amp; Bom N\341\273\225 Ch\341\272\255m</span>\\n        </span>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Bomb Display Container */}\\n      <div className={`\\n        relative w-full p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border-2 transition-all flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[300px]\\n        ${isExploded \\n          ? \'bg-red-500/20 border-red-500 shadow-2xl scale-105\' \\n          : isRunning \\n            ? \'bg-amber-500/10 border-amber-500/50 shadow-xl animate-pulse\' \\n            : \'bg-surface border-token shadow-sm\'}\\n      `}>\\n        {/* Fuse Progress Bar */}\\n        <div className=\\\"w-full max-w-xs h-2.5 bg-surface-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-token mb-6\\\">\\n          <div \\n            className=\\\"h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-orange-500 to-red-500 transition-all duration-75\\\"\\n            style={{ width: `${fusePercent}%` }}\\n          />\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Central Graphic */}\\n        <div className=\\\"relative mb-4\\\">\\n          {isExploded ? (\\n            <div className=\\\"text-6xl sm:text-7xl animate-bounce select-none\\\">\\n              \360\237\222\245\\n            </div>\\n          ) : (\\n            <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n              <div className={`\\n                w-28 h-28 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-gray-900 to-gray-700 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-2xl border-4 border-gray-600\\n                ${isRunning ? \'animate-bounce\' : \'\'}\\n              `}>\\n                <Bomb className=\\\"w-14 h-14 text-red-500\\\" />\\n              </div>\\n              {/* Burning Spark */}\\n              {isRunning && (\\n                <div className=\\\"absolute -top-3 -right-2 text-2xl animate-spin\\\">\\n                  \360\237\224\245\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Name Display */}\\n        <div className=\\\"min-h-[64px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center\\\">\\n          {currentCandidate ? (\\n            <div className=\\\"animate-scale-up\\\">\\n              <h3 className=\\\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-main tracking-tight\\\">\\n                {currentCandidate.hoTen}\\n              </h3>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-muted mt-0.5\\\">\\n                T\341\273\225 {currentCandidate.to} \302\267 Gh\341\272\277 #{currentCandidate.viTriGhe}\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          ) : (\\n            <div className=\\\"text-xs text-muted font-medium\\\">\\n              S\341\272\265n s\303\240ng ch\303\242m ng\303\262i! Nh\341\272\245n n\303\272t b\303\252n d\306\260\341\273\233i \3