  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Class Emblems**\n\nI\'m now diving into crafting unique emblems for class leaders and team heads. I\'m also planning a diverse collection of distinctive badges and frames to enhance the visual appeal of these designs. My goal is to create something truly special and engaging.\n\n\n**Developing Rank Insignia**\n\nI\'m presently building distinct insignia for class leaders, focusing on unique symbols. For the class leader, I\'m leaning towards a regal crown or a badge of authority. The secretary could have a fiery flag or a badge emphasizing leadership. I envision a book and golden pen for the academic leader and a lightning bolt for the labor leader. For team leaders, I\'m considering protective shields. All are designed with custom SVG crests with glowing colors.\n\n\n**Creating Honors Badges**\n\nI\'m now formulating a comprehensive system of honors badges and special avatar frames. I\'ve designed several distinct frames, including a Diamond Champion frame with glowing emeralds, a Platinum Elite frame featuring neon-blue accents and angel wings, and a Gold Royal frame with a small crown. I\'m also developing an Iron Discipline frame for consistent performance and a Lightning Comeback frame for significant progress, alongside others.\n\n\n**Expanding Badge Selection**\n\nI\'m now expanding the badge selection with new frames like the \"Noble Paragon\" with an elegant jade border for teacher-nominated students. I\'m also adding honorary badges: \"Top Discipline Student,\" \"Top 3 Star,\" \"Iron Discipline,\" \"Punctuality Champion,\" \"Diligent Scholar,\" \"Spectacular Breakthrough,\" and \"Connected Heart.\" Teachers will have a \"Honor Frames & Badges Management\" panel to customize and auto-award frames.\n\n\n"
