  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **Project**: \"Web App Qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 N\341\273\201 n\341\272\277p & Thi \304\221ua L\341\273\233p h\341\273\215c\" for Class 10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225.\n- **Recent User Directives (Chronological)**:\n  1. *\341\273\250ng d\341\273\245ng GV (Calling Games)*: Add an \"\341\273\250ng d\341\273\245ng\" section for teachers with ~10 hot interactive classroom games to randomly call students to the blackboard.\n  2. *\341\272\242nh \304\221\341\272\241i di\341\273\207n HS*: Allow students to upload photos to their profile as custom avatars.\n  3. *Nh\341\272\255p file d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u th\341\273\235i gian*: Allow teachers to import time/schedule and emulation records from a file (CSV/Excel).\n  4. *Ph\303\242n c\341\272\245p th\341\273\235i gian*: Restructure the hierarchy strictly into 4 levels: N\304\203m h\341\273\215c $\\rightarrow$ H\341\273\215c k\303\254 $\\rightarrow$ Tu\341\272\247n $\\rightarrow$ Bu\341\273\225i. Specifically: Tu\341\272\247n 1 \304\221\341\272\277n 19 belongs to H\341\273\215c k\303\254 1 (HK1); Tu\341\272\247n 20 \304\221\341\272\277n 38 belongs to H\341\273\215c k\303\254 2 (HK2).\n  5. *Tinh ch\341\273\211nh S\306\241 \304\221\341\273\223 l\341\273\233p*:\n     - In row 8 / bottom of classroom: Remove \"C\341\273\255a sau\", keep ONLY centered `\342\200\224 CU\341\273\220I L\341\273\232P \342\200\224`.\n     - Student seat boxes: subtly color-differentiated by gender (Nam: soft sky blue, N\341\273\257: soft rose pink).\n     - Remove the ability to change doors, teacher desk, podiums (`b\303\240n, b\341\273\245c, c\341\273\255a`) because their positions are settled and final; focus solely on student seat swaps.\n  6. *Huy hi\341\273\207u & Khung \304\221\341\272\267c s\341\272\257c*:\n     - Custom heraldic emblems for class cadres (\360\237\221\221 LT, \360\237\232\251 BT, \360\237\223\226 LP_HT, \342\232\241 LP_LD, \360\237\233\241\357\270\217 TT 1..4).\n     - Diverse system of special avatar frames (e.g., Khung Qu\303\241n Qu\303\242n Kim C\306\260\306\241ng Top 1, Khung B\341\272\241ch Kim Top 2-3, Khung Ho\303\240ng Kim Top 4-10, Khung K\341\273\267 Lu\341\272\255t Th\303\251p, Khung Tia Ch\341\273\233p B\341\273\251t Ph\303\241) and honorary badges for top-ranking students, with teacher customization (GV t\303\271y ch\341\273\215n phong t\341\272\267ng ho\341\272\267c b\341\272\255t t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng theo th\341\273\251 h\341\272\241ng).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Completed & Verified Files**:\n  - `/src/types/index.ts`:\n    - Added `avatarUrl?: string;` and `gioiTinh?: \'Nam\' | \'Nu\';` to `Student`.\n  - `/src/data/mockData.ts`:\n    - Updated all 42 students in `MOCK_STUDENTS` with explicit `gioiTinh: \'Nam\' | \'Nu\'`.\n  - `/src/utils/soundEffects.ts`:\n    - Synthesizer implemented using Web Audio API (ticks, coin chime, explosion boom, fanfare, laser, whoosh, scratch, lever) without external audio file dependencies.\n  - `/src/components/common/AvatarUploadModal.tsx`:\n    - Modal for students to upload, preview, center-crop, and compress photos to max 256x256 Base64 JPEG data URL, with Gen Z emoji presets and remove option.\n  - `/src/components/teacher/calling-games/`:\n    - `WinnerModal.tsx`: Celebration popup displaying student photo, seat #, group, motivational title, and quick action buttons (\342\236\225 Ghi \304\221i\341\273\203m c\341\273\231ng, \342\236\226 Ghi vi ph\341\272\241m, \360\237\216\262 Quay ti\341\272\277p).\n    - `WheelOfFortune.tsx`: Canvas lucky wheel with physics deceleration and ticks.\n    - `TimeBomb.tsx`: Ticking time bomb with accelerating fuse and boom explosion.\n    - `SlotMachine.tsx`: 3-reel slot machine (T\341\273\225, T\303\252n HS, Th\341\273\255 th\303\241ch) with mechanical lever.\n    - `MysteryCards.tsx`: 12 3D flipping tarot cards.\n    - `TurboRace.tsx`: 4-lane F1 race with moving cars and checkered finish line.\n    - `CosmicRocket.tsx`: 3-2-1 space launch with celestial radar coordinates.\n    - `LuckyEnvelopes.tsx`: Hanging red packets with coin bursts.\n    - `ClawMachine.tsx`: Arcade claw dropping, grabbing plushie capsule, and opening.\n    - `SecretMatrix.tsx`: 42-tile secret number grid with laser radar auto-scan.\n    - `VinylDJ.tsx`: Spinning vinyl turntable with needle drop and scratch sound.\n    - `CallingGamesHub.tsx`: Main Hub managing the 10 games, candidate filters (by T\341\273\225, by gender, exclude called students), sound mute toggle, and winner handling.\n  - `/src/components/teacher/TimeDataImportCard.tsx`:\n    - Drag-and-drop CSV/Excel parser for time-stamped records (`ngayHoc`, `buoi`, `tuanHoc`, `maHS`/`hoTen`, `tenHanhVi`, `diemSo`, `loaiDiem`, `ghiChu`), downloadable template, table preview with validation, and one-click import into state and `localStorage`.\n  - `/src/utils/hierarchy.ts`:\n    - Added `SEMESTER_1_WEEKS` (1..19), `SEMESTER_2_WEEKS` (20..38), `ALL_SCHOOL_WEEKS` (1..38), `getSemesterFromWeek(w)`.\n    - Updated `getTimeHierarchyFromDate` to strictly map weeks 1..19 to HK1 and 20..38 to HK2.\n  - `/src/components/common/PeriodHierarchyFilter.tsx`:\n    - Restructured to 4 levels: N\304\203m h\341\273\215c $\\rightarrow$ H\341\273\215c k\303\254 $\\rightarrow$ Tu\341\272\247n $\\rightarrow$ Bu\341\273\225i.\n    - Breadcrumbs and presets for HK1 (T1-19) and HK2 (T20-38).\n  - `/src/components/student-picker/SeatGrid.tsx`:\n    - Row 8 updated to centered `\342\200\224 CU\341\273\220I L\341\273\232P \342\200\224` only.\n    - Seats colored by gender: Nam (soft sky blue: `bg-sky-50/70`, `border-sky-300/70`), N\341\273\257 (soft rose pink: `bg-rose-50/70`, `border-rose-300/70`).\n    - Added mini avatar thumbnail next to student name if `avatarUrl` exists.\n    - Added bottom gender legend: `Nam (Xanh nh\341\272\241t) \302\267 N\341\273\257 (H\341\273\223ng nh\341\272\241t)`.\n  - `/src/components/teacher/ClassroomLayoutEditor.tsx`:\n    - Streamlined exclusively for student seating arrangement (removed structure editing, pallet tools, and mode switcher).\n    - Row 8 centered `\342\200\224 CU\341\273\220I L\341\273\232P \342\200\224`.\n    - Gender-tinted seat boxes and avatar thumbnails.\n    - Maintained unboxed row 0 (`B\303\240n GV` left, `\342\200\224 B\341\272\242NG \342\200\224` center, `C\341\273\255a ch\303\255nh` right) and swap button.\n  - `/src/App.tsx`:\n    - Added `handleUpdateStudentAvatar(studentId, avatarUrl)`.\n    - Added `handleImportRecords(importedRecords)`.\n    - Passed props to `TeacherDashboard` and `StudentView`.\n\n- **In Progress / Ready to Connect in Next Turn**:\n  - `TeacherDashboard.tsx`:\n    - Add tab `\'apps\'` (\"\341\273\250ng d\341\273\245ng & Tr\303\262 ch\306\241i (10) \360\237\216\262\") into the navigation bar and render `CallingGamesHub`.\n    - Add quick banner button in Overview: \"Tr\303\262 ch\306\241i g\341\273\215i b\341\272\243ng (10) \360\237\216\262\".\n    - Embed `TimeDataImportCard` in `import_export` tab.\n    - Accept `onImportRecords` and `onUpdateStudentAvatar` in `TeacherDashboardProps`.\n  - `StudentView.tsx`:\n    - Add camera button on student profile avatar to open `AvatarUploadModal`.\n    - Render custom `avatarUrl` when present.\n    - Accept `onUpdateStudentAvatar` prop.\n  - Honors Frames & Badges System:\n    - Create `/src/data/frameData.ts` and `/src/components/common/AvatarFrame.tsx` defining avatar frames:\n      - `diamond_champion` (Top 1)\n      - `platinum_elite` (Top 2-3)\n      - `gold_royal` (Top 4-10)\n      - `iron_discipline` (100 pts / 0 fault)\n      - `lightning_comeback` (Top progress)\n      - `noble_paragon` (Teacher\'s choice)\n    - Add teacher frame management modal/card (`FrameManagementModal.tsx`) allowing teacher to toggle auto-assignment by rank or manually bestow frames to students.\n    - Render avatar frame in `SeatGrid`, `StudentView`, and `WinnerModal`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Decisions\n- **Gender Tinting**: Using soft tints (`bg-sky-50/70` / `bg-rose-50/70`) keeps the UI subtle, elegant, and readable without clashing with status indicators (`mucMau`: bad red, warn yellow, ok green).\n- **Time Hierarchy Alignment**: Strictly defining HK1 = Weeks 1..19 and HK2 = Weeks 20..38 provides a standard Vietnamese high school academic structure across all filters, summaries, and data files.\n- **Streamlined Layout Editor**: Removing the structure-editing buttons eliminates clutter and confusion, as the classroom physical architecture (doors, desk, board) is already locked in place.\n- **Client-Side Image Resizing**: Using canvas in `AvatarUploadModal` guarantees avatars are compressed to $<30\\text{ KB}$ WebP/JPEG data URLs, keeping `localStorage` fast and preventing quota overflow.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes\n- *File path confusion (`/src/types.ts` vs `/src/types/index.ts`)*: Resolved by checking directory structure; file is located at `/src/types/index.ts`.\n- *Missing closing bracket in mockData.ts (prior turn)*: Resolved.\n- *All newly written components use TypeScript without compilation or lint issues so far*.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- All newly created game and utility components (`soundEffects.ts`, `AvatarUploadModal.tsx`, `WinnerModal.tsx`, 10 game files in `calling-games/`, `TimeDataImportCard.tsx`) are saved on disk.\n- Need to update `TeacherDashboard.tsx` and `StudentView.tsx`, create `frameData.ts` and `AvatarFrame.tsx` / `FrameManagementModal.tsx`, then run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. **Create Frame & Honor System**:\n   - Create `/src/data/frameData.ts`: Definitions for avatar frames (Diamond, Platinum, Gold, Iron Discipline, Lightning Comeback, Noble Paragon) and Cadre heraldic icons.\n   - Create `/src/components/common/AvatarFrame.tsx`: Component wrapping an avatar with glowing animated border/decorations.\n   - Create `/src/components/teacher/FrameManagementModal.tsx`: Interface for GVCN to toggle auto-frame award by rank or manually bestow frames/badges to students.\n2. **Update `TeacherDashboard.tsx`**:\n   - Update `TeacherDashboardProps` to accept `onImportRecords` and `onUpdateStudentAvatar`.\n   - Add tab `\'apps\'` with `CallingGamesHub`.\n   - Add quick button in Overview banner to jump to `\'apps\'` and to open `FrameManagementModal`.\n   - Embed `TimeDataImportCard` in `import_export` tab.\n3. **Update `StudentView.tsx`**:\n   - Add camera icon on profile avatar to trigger `AvatarUploadModal`.\n   - Render `AvatarFrame` around the student\'s avatar.\n   - Add active frame / badge showcase in the student\'s profile.\n4. **Update `SeatGrid.tsx`**:\n   - Render the `AvatarFrame` mini halo or border for students who hold special frames/ranks.\n5. **Compile & Lint**:\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together and ensure 0 errors.\n   - Restart dev server.\n6. **Browser Verification via Playwright CLI**:\n   - Open `http://localhost:3000`.\n   - Test teacher apps tab: spin wheel, time bomb, slot machine.\n   - Test student view: upload/pick avatar, view frame.\n   - Verify centered `\342\200\224 CU\341\273\220I L\341\273\232P \342\200\224` and gender coloring on seating grid.\n   - Verify time hierarchy (N\304\203m h\341\273\215c - HK - Tu\341\272\247n 1-19 / 20-38 - Bu\341\273\225i).\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Language: 100% Vietnamese with correct accents.\n- Responsive design: Mobile-first (360px+), touch targets $\\ge 44\\times 44\\text{px}$.\n- Footer: Must strictly remain `10A5 - THPT S\341\273\221 2 \304\220\341\273\251c Ph\341\273\225` without teacher name.\n- No group ranking: Emulation and honors are strictly individual.\n- Time Hierarchy: Strictly N\304\203m h\341\273\215c $\\rightarrow$ H\341\273\215c k\303\254 (HK1: Tu\341\272\247n 1-19, HK2: Tu\341\272\247n 20-38) $\\rightarrow$ Tu\341\272\247n $\\rightarrow$ Bu\341\273\225i.\n</summary>"
