  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Component Props**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `TeacherDashboard.tsx` file and defining some crucial props. I\'ve decided to incorporate `onImportRecords`, `onUpdateStudentAvatar`, and `onAssignFrame` to enhance the dashboard\'s functionality, making it more flexible and capable. These props will enable imports, avatar updates, and frame assignments.\n\n\n**Implementing Dashboard Enhancements**\n\nI\'m now integrating new tabs and quick action buttons into the `TeacherDashboard`. I\'ve added a new \'apps\' tab, along with quick access buttons in the hero banner to trigger the app tab and frame management modal. Also, I\'ve incorporated `TimeDataImportCard` into the \'import\\_export\' tab, and `CallingGamesHub` into the \'apps\' tab, further refining the user interface.\n\n\n"
