    thinking: "**Confirming Current Alignment**\n\nI\'ve confirmed that the existing `PeriodHierarchyFilter.tsx` component is already aligned with the desired structure. The levels \342\200\223 N\304\203m h\341\273\215c, H\341\273\215c k\303\254, Tu\341\272\247n h\341\273\215c, and Bu\341\273\225i h\341\273\215c \342\200\223 are present, and \"th\303\241ng\" (month) is correctly omitted from the user interface.\n\n\n**Designing Time Hierarchy**\n\nI\'m now focusing on implementing the time hierarchy within `RecordBottomSheet.tsx`. My plan is to display time controls at the top of the sheet. I\'m thinking of a design with dropdowns for H\341\273\215c k\303\254 and Tu\341\272\247n h\341\273\215c, dynamically updating the week options based on the selected H\341\273\215c k\303\254. There will also be a Bu\341\273\225i h\341\273\215c toggle and a date picker. I\'m making sure \"Th\303\241ng\" is omitted from the UI. The selection of a week should set both `tuanHoc` and `hocKi`. Changes in `hocKi` trigger updates to the week options.\n\n\n"
