  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering UI Enhancements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `TeacherDashboard.tsx` file. I\'m adding a tab button. This button will trigger a change to the active tab, and will be styled for a nice user experience. I\'m also ensuring the styling is consistent.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Cues**\n\nI\'ve been working on styling the tab button for a better UI/UX. Currently, I\'m using conditional classes to handle the active and inactive states. The \"apps\" tab\'s style now responds to the `activeTab` state, and I\'m employing hover effects to make the interface more dynamic. I am also working on adding hover states for the banner buttons.\n\n\n**Implementing Button Interactions**\n\nI\'ve added hover effects, a purple background, a blur effect, and a shadow to a button, along with text styling. I\'m also implementing a transition effect for a smooth visual change. I\'m focusing on ensuring these effects provide clear visual cues for user interaction, making the interface more intuitive and responsive.\n\n\n"
