  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Navigation Contexts**\n\nI\'m currently focused on identifying all the locations within the system where a \"Back\" button would be beneficial. I\'m cataloging various navigation points like content details, modals, sub-views, games, tabs, and drill-down areas to ensure the button\'s implementation is comprehensive.\n\n\n**Defining Back Button Locations**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed specific areas requiring \"back\" buttons. For teacher apps, I\'m integrating a return button to the games grid within `CallingGamesHub.tsx`. For the teacher dashboard, I\'ll add \"Back to Overview\" buttons to sub-tabs in `TeacherDashboard.tsx`. I\'ve also identified the need for \"Back to My Score\" buttons for student views within `StudentView.tsx` and \"Back to Notes\" buttons for cadre views in `CadreView.tsx`. Next I\'ll tackle the modals.\n\n\n"
