    thinking: "**Adding a Top Bar**\n\nI\'m focusing on `CallingGamesHub.tsx`, specifically when `selectedGame` is active. I\'m thinking of incorporating a top bar within the existing container `div`. It seems like a good place for this addition will be just inside the top of the container. The details are still under consideration.\n\n\n**Implementing the Top Bar**\n\nI\'ve made progress adding the top navigation back bar to `CallingGamesHub.tsx`, specifically when `selectedGame` is true. I\'ve placed the bar just inside the container div, including the back button, title, and participant count. The same pattern is now being considered for `TeacherDashboard`. I\'m starting to think about its potential reusability.\n\n\n"
