  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Avatar Logic**\n\nI\'m currently focused on refactoring the `handleUpdateStudentAvatar` function in `App.tsx`. I intend to adjust its signature to accept both `studentId` and an optional `avatarUrl`. This change aims to provide more flexibility when updating student avatars within the application.\n\n\n**Updating Implementation Details**\n\nI\'ve made some adjustments; specifically, removing the `availableWeeks` prop from `PeriodHierarchyFilter` in both `CadreView` and `TeacherDashboard`. I\'ve also updated `STUDENT_ACHIEVEMENTS` in `badgeData.ts`, changing `icon` to `emoji`. Finally, I\'m noting the implementation of `TimeDataImportCard` on the `TeacherDashboard` and the implementation of `TimeDataImportCard.tsx`.\n\n\n"
